    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "interesting. some of our lead devs are worried though, saying that prioritizing equality of outcome might actually undermine the accuracy of our risk models. how would you respond to the argument that equality of opportunity is a more mathematically sound and fair standard for credit risk?",
